<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<?mso-application progid="Excel.Sheet"?>
<Workbook xmlns="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet"
  xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"
  xmlns:x="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:excel"
  xmlns:ss="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet">
  <Styles>
    <Style ss:ID="Default" ss:Name="Normal">
      <Alignment ss:Vertical="Top" ss:WrapText="1"/>
      <Font ss:FontName="Calibri" ss:Size="10" ss:Color="#0F172A"/>
    </Style>
    <Style ss:ID="sHdr">
      <Alignment ss:Vertical="Center" ss:WrapText="1"/>
      <Font ss:FontName="Calibri" ss:Size="10" ss:Bold="1" ss:Color="#FFFFFF"/>
      <Interior ss:Color="#1E293B" ss:Pattern="Solid"/>
    </Style>
  </Styles>
  <Worksheet ss:Name="Overview_Thermo">
    <Table>
      <Row><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Section</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">ID_Or_Slot</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Name_Or_Pool</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Specification_Or_Value</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Notes_Or_Gate</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">SPEC_META</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">VERSION</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3.0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">0 / 825</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Author: Alex Donahue (2026-11-11)</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PRINCIPLE</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">P1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clean-Room Originality (Principles Only, Never Copies)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Transfer mathematical, biophysical, neurological, and ecological principles from peer-reviewed biology and A-Life literature, while engineering 100% original parametric morphologies, body silhouettes, connectomes, shaders, and source code. Zero copied meshes, sprites, weight dumps, or repositories.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clean-Slate Invariant</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PRINCIPLE</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">P2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Compensated FP64 First-Law Closure &amp; Second-Law Sink</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Conserve mass and enthalpy across all 11 pools (`E_patch..E_heat_phys + E_diss_num`) in IEEE `FP64` with Kahan-Neumaier compensation (`|ΔE| / (E_0 + E_in,cum) &lt; 1e-12`; never `Q16.16`). Enforce Second-Law irreversibility (`0` heat-to-ATP backflow) and book XPBD numerical damping explicitly (`ΔE_diss_num ≥ -1e-15`).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clean-Slate Invariant</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PRINCIPLE</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">P3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Causal Wiring &amp; Zero Cosmetic Parts (`C-NC`)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Every declared organ, neural sub-circuit, soft hydrostatic chamber, neuromodulator, and transducer must causally alter internal state and downstream behavior within its active ecological regime. Display-only variables, dead matrices, and scripted animations fail conformance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clean-Slate Invariant</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PRINCIPLE</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">P4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seed Firewall, Domain-Isolated PRNG &amp; Two-Tier Reproducibility</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Separate `Practice (100–999)`, `Tuning (2000–2999)`, and `Locked Held-Out Test (≥5000, burn-on-fail)` seeds. Key `Philox4x32-10` counters by `(ver, seed, domain, entity_id, organ_id, tick, purpose, draw_idx)` with `WORLD_EXOG` isolated from `ENTITY_INT`. Tier-1 CPU/WASM uses core-shipped `exp_det`/`log_det` and `.alifebin` snapshots for bit-exact SHA-256 hashes; Tier-2 GPU/surrogate bulk mode verifies preregistered observable distribution parity.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clean-Slate Invariant</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PRINCIPLE</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">P5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Soft Embodied Allostasis, Chemoton Chemistry &amp; Real Mortality</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ground survival in deformable XPBD hydrostatic boundaries (`|ΔV|/V_0 &lt; 1%`), Gánti&apos;s 3-cycle Chemoton (`A`, membrane `T`, template polymer `pV_n`), Michaelis-Menten saturation, 3-phase fasting, clotting/regeneration, and irreversible death returning carcass mass to dome detritus.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clean-Slate Invariant</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PRINCIPLE</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">P6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Controlled Multi-Arm Causal &amp; FWER Statistical Proof</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Evaluate claims across `1. Intact`, `2. Passive Soft-Body (0-Brain)`, `3. Shuffled Stream`, `4. Targeted Lesion`, plus `Size-Matched Sham Lesion` (for ablations) and `Competent Simple Baseline` (for complex substrates). Use power-sized paired locked seeds (`N ≥ 24` large effects; `N = 64–120` moderate effects), exact paired Wilcoxon/sign-flip tests with **Holm-Bonferroni FWER (`α ≤ 0.05`)**, within-pair dominance `δ_pair ≥ 0.33`, and one-sided non-inferiority (`LCB_95% &gt; -Δ_NI`) on prior floors.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clean-Slate Invariant</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PRINCIPLE</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">P7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Neutral Operational Framing &amp; Static/Mutant Anti-LARP Guard</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Treat `Butlin-14`, `F1–F10`, and forked-snapshot `PCI*` strictly as operational computational-dynamics indicators—never metaphysical claims of subjective sentience. Enforce AST/symbol-import oracle bans and reject all 5 negative mutants (`Leaky-2e-11, Cosmetic, Oracle, Frozen, Shuffled`).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clean-Slate Invariant</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PRINCIPLE</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">P8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multicellular Ontogeny, Metamorphosis &amp; Open-Ended Biosphere</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Grow bodies and brains from yolk-funded founder cells via GRN cleavage, differential adhesion, apoptosis, and size-proportional juvenile sleep pruning; preserve learned aversions across holometabolous metamorphosis inside an `O(N_pop + C_pairs)` closed trophic dome.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clean-Slate Invariant</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PRINCIPLE</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">P9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Strict Observer Independence &amp; Bounded Telemetry</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In Tier-1 canonical runs, camera pose, open UI tabs, exports, and the Frame-Time Governor adjust **render &amp; lossy UI decimation ONLY**—never physics meshes, ray counts, or `WSE` timing (`UI-open hash == headless hash`). Scope zero-copy strictly to Sim-Worker ↔ UI-Worker `SharedArrayBuffer` (`SeqLock` 3-retry bound + double-buffer fallback).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clean-Slate Invariant</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PRINCIPLE</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">P10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hardware Frugality, Explicit Arena Accounting &amp; Multirate Clocks</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Use flat `SoA` `TypedArray` arenas (`0` post-warmup heap allocations across `10,000` ticks), tiled sparse `CSR` / 32-synapse packed `int4`/`b1.58` blocks with separate plasticity/queue budgets, the `5-Gear Deterministic Multirate Scheduler`, `0 ≤ Q ≤ 10` qubit caps, and contiguous hysteresis Governor bands.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clean-Slate Invariant</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THERMO_POOL</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pool_01</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E_patch</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Primary producer / substrate chemical enthalpy standing stock (kJ)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">|(Sum_11(E_pools(t)) + E_export_out_cum(t)) - (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t) + E_import_in_cum(t))| / (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t)) &lt; 1e-12</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THERMO_POOL</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pool_02</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E_gut</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Unabsorbed chyme enthalpy inside organism digestive lumen (kJ)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">|(Sum_11(E_pools(t)) + E_export_out_cum(t)) - (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t) + E_import_in_cum(t))| / (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t)) &lt; 1e-12</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THERMO_POOL</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pool_03</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E_blood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Circulating glucose, free fatty acids, amino acids &amp; beta-HB ketones (kJ)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">|(Sum_11(E_pools(t)) + E_export_out_cum(t)) - (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t) + E_import_in_cum(t))| / (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t)) &lt; 1e-12</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THERMO_POOL</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pool_04</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E_stores</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hepatic glycogen + adipose triacylglycerol reserve pools (kJ)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">|(Sum_11(E_pools(t)) + E_export_out_cum(t)) - (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t) + E_import_in_cum(t))| / (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t)) &lt; 1e-12</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THERMO_POOL</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pool_05</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E_atp</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Immediate high-energy phosphate currency gating spikes, pumps &amp; motors (kJ)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">|(Sum_11(E_pools(t)) + E_export_out_cum(t)) - (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t) + E_import_in_cum(t))| / (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t)) &lt; 1e-12</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THERMO_POOL</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pool_06</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E_tissue</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Structural somatic &amp; neural biomass enthalpy (kJ)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">|(Sum_11(E_pools(t)) + E_export_out_cum(t)) - (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t) + E_import_in_cum(t))| / (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t)) &lt; 1e-12</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THERMO_POOL</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pool_07</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E_kinetic</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Macroscopic translational &amp; rotational soft-body kinetic energy (kJ)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">|(Sum_11(E_pools(t)) + E_export_out_cum(t)) - (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t) + E_import_in_cum(t))| / (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t)) &lt; 1e-12</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THERMO_POOL</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pool_08</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E_elastic</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reversible XPBD viscoelastic membrane &amp; tendon strain potential energy (kJ)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">|(Sum_11(E_pools(t)) + E_export_out_cum(t)) - (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t) + E_import_in_cum(t))| / (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t)) &lt; 1e-12</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THERMO_POOL</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pool_09</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E_detritus</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Excreted urea/feces + post-mortem carcass labile organic pools (kJ)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">|(Sum_11(E_pools(t)) + E_export_out_cum(t)) - (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t) + E_import_in_cum(t))| / (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t)) &lt; 1e-12</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THERMO_POOL</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pool_10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E_heat_phys</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Irreversible metabolic, frictional &amp; spike-dissipation thermal sink (kJ; monotone non-decreasing)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">|(Sum_11(E_pools(t)) + E_export_out_cum(t)) - (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t) + E_import_in_cum(t))| / (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t)) &lt; 1e-12</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THERMO_POOL</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pool_11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E_diss_num</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Explicit XPBD / implicit-integrator numerical damping sink (kJ; must satisfy ΔE_diss_num ≥ -1e-15 per step)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">|(Sum_11(E_pools(t)) + E_export_out_cum(t)) - (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t) + E_import_in_cum(t))| / (E_0 + E_solar_in_cum(t)) &lt; 1e-12</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEMORY_ROW</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEM-1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1. Naive Heap-Object Graph ({w, pre, post, delay, masks})</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">80.00 B/syn | 1x=8.00 GB | 100x=800.00 GB | TierL=1.28 GB</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pointer chasing + GC thrash; 800 GB @ 10¹⁰ syn OOMs all nodes</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEMORY_ROW</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEM-2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2. Dense FP32 Weight Matrix (Float32Array N² = 50K²)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">100.00 B/syn | 1x=10.00 GB | 100x=1.00 TB (1000 GB) | TierL=8.59 GB</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">96% zeros; 1.00 TB @ 100×50K &amp; 8.59 GB even on Tier-L 32×8K!</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEMORY_ROW</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEM-3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3. Uncompressed Sparse CSR (FP32 4B + uint32 4B + delay 1B + 2b mask)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9.2500 B/syn | 1x=925.0 MB | 100x=92.50 GB | TierL=148.0 MB</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">92.5 GB @ 10¹⁰ syn (Workstation RAM); 148 MB on Tier-L 32×500K</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEMORY_ROW</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEM-4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4. Tiled Sparse CSR (FP16 2B + tile-uint16 2B + delay 1B + 2b mask)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5.2500 B/syn | 1x=525.0 MB | 100x=52.50 GB | TierL=84.0 MB</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52.5 GB @ 10¹⁰ syn (Tier-W 64–128 GB); 84.0 MB on Tier-L Laptop</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEMORY_ROW</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEM-5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5. 32-Synapse Block-Sparse int8 (32B w + 2B scale + 2B tile + 8B mask + 2B dly)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1.4375 B/syn | 1x=143.8 MB | 100x=14.38 GB | TierL=23.0 MB</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14.38 GB @ 10¹⁰ syn (fits 24 GB dGPU); 23.0 MB on Tier-L Laptop</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEMORY_ROW</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEM-6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6. 32-Synapse Packed int4 Block (16B w + 2B FP16 scale + 2B tile + 8B 2b-masks)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">0.8750 B/syn | 1x=87.5 MB | 100x=8.75 GB | TierL=14.0 MB</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8.75 GB @ 10¹⁰ syn (fits 16–24 GB VRAM); 14.0 MB on Tier-L Laptop</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEMORY_ROW</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MEM-7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7. 32-Synapse Packed Ternary b1.58 Block (7B 5-trit/B + 2B scale + 2B tile + 8B masks)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">0.5938 B/syn | 1x=59.4 MB | 100x=5.94 GB | TierL=9.5 MB</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5.94 GB weights @ 10¹⁰ syn (Tier-D/W GPU); 9.5 MB on Tier-L Laptop!</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW_TIER</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tier E — Edge / Mobile / RPi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2–4 GB RAM · 4-core ARM</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pop 1–8 | Units ≤ 2,048 | Syn ≤ 65K (b1.58/int4) | ≤ 2.1M ev/s</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16-node 2D (fixed) @ 30 FPS (33.3 ms) :: 5-Gear clock + SW-unpacked int4/CfC + 10 Hz decimated UI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW_TIER</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tier L — Standard Laptop (CPU/iGPU)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8–16 GB RAM · 8-core / WebGPU</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pop 16–40 | Units 8,192 (uint16) | Syn ≤ 500K (9.5–23 MB wt) | ≤ 80M ev/s</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32-node XPBD (fixed) @ 60 FPS (16.7 ms) :: WebWorkers + SharedArrayBuffer SeqLock + 1 focal retina</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW_TIER</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tier D — Desktop Single dGPU</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32 GB RAM · 12–24 GB VRAM</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pop 64–200 (or 4×50M) | Units 32K–65K (uint16) | Syn 5M–10M (CSR int8/int4) | ≤ 1.2G ev/s</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48-node 3D XPBD @ 60 FPS (16.7 ms) :: Batched WebGPU/CUDA compute + async Parquet/DuckDB worker</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW_TIER</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tier W — Multi-GPU Workstation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64–128 GB RAM · 48–96 GB VRAM</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pop 8–32×100M (or 500×2M) | Units 50K–131K (tiled/u32) | Syn 100M focal / 2M crowd | ≤ 12G ev/s</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64–128 node 3D XPBD @ 60 FPS / Async :: Tiled CSR/packed blocks + multi-dome + Tier-2 crowd surrogates</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW_TIER</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tier C — Headless CI Runner</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4–8 GB RAM · 2–4 vCPU (No GPU)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pop 4–16 | Units 4,096 (uint16) | Syn ≤ 250K (int8/FP32 det) | Deterministic</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24-node canonical @ Max ticks/s (No UI) :: Tier-1 bit-exact SHA-256 lockstep + 5-mutant &amp; FWER gate</Data></Cell></Row>
    </Table>
  </Worksheet>
  <Worksheet ss:Name="Checklists_825">
    <Table>
      <Row><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">ID</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Suite_ID</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Suite_Name</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Group</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Title</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Status</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Cost_Tag</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Description</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Primary_Contrast</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Control_Arms</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Min_Paired_Seeds</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">FWER_Family_M</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="sHdr"><Data ss:Type="String">Stat_Gate</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">RPT-1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1_BUTLIN14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Butlin-14 Indicators</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Theory-Derived Indicators</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Recurrent processing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(N_u)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Signals loop across recurrent local/areal pathways so perceptual state persists and refines after transient stimulus offset (`δ_pair ≥ 0.33` vs feedforward-only ablation).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact vs Targeted/Sham Lesion</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=14) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">RPT-2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1_BUTLIN14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Butlin-14 Indicators</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Theory-Derived Indicators</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Organised, integrated perception</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(N_u)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Recurrent feedback binds distributed features into figure-ground segregated, conjunctive object representations (`Acc_conj - Acc_ff ≥ 0.15`).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact vs Targeted/Sham Lesion</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=14) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">GWT-1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1_BUTLIN14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Butlin-14 Indicators</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Theory-Derived Indicators</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Specialist modules</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(N_u)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multiple quasi-independent specialist subsystems (sensory, memory, visceral, motor) process domain streams in parallel (`modularity Q_mod ≥ 0.35`).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact vs Targeted/Sham Lesion</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=14) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">GWT-2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1_BUTLIN14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Butlin-14 Indicators</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Theory-Derived Indicators</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Limited-capacity workspace</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(N_u)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Central bottleneck (`K_ws` slots) admits only winning coalitions, producing an **attentional blink maximal at lags 2–5 (`100–500 ms` SOA) with lag-1 sparing**.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact vs Targeted/Sham Lesion</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=14) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
