      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">CQM24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3_CQM25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">CQM-25 Core Qualities</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Core Organism Qualities</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic reproducibility</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(N_u)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Identical seed + Tier-1 config yields bit-exact SHA-256 state hash; perturbing any declared causal part diverges trajectory `&gt; ε_noise` in its active regime.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact vs Targeted/Sham Lesion</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=25) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
