      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW01</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A. Memory arenas, explicit byte accounting &amp; zero-allocation loop (HW01–HW06)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Flat Structure-of-Arrays (SoA) arenas</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All neuron, synapse, soft-vertex, and chemical states reside in pre-allocated contiguous `TypedArray` arenas (`0` per-synapse heap objects).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW02</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A. Memory arenas, explicit byte accounting &amp; zero-allocation loop (HW01–HW06)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10,000-tick zero-allocation &amp; fixed WASM</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Profiler verifies **`0` heap allocations, `0` `BigInt` boxes, `0` WASM `memory.grow` calls, and `0` lossless-ring drops** across `10,000` post-warmup ticks.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW03</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A. Memory arenas, explicit byte accounting &amp; zero-allocation loop (HW01–HW06)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tiled sparse CSR (`5.25 B/syn` FP16)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Uses tiled `uint16` CSR (`≤ 65,536` units/tile + base table, `5.25 B/syn`) or `uint32` CSR (`9.25 B/syn`); never dense `4N²` at sparse `ρ ≤ 10%`.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW04</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A. Memory arenas, explicit byte accounting &amp; zero-allocation loop (HW01–HW06)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32-synapse packed `int4`/`b1.58` + inventory</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Packs 32 synapses into `28 B` (`int4 = 0.875 B/syn`) or `19 B` (`b1.58 = 0.594 B/syn`); budgets `+0.40 B/syn` sparse plasticity ring &amp; `CSR` overlay separately.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW05</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A. Memory arenas, explicit byte accounting &amp; zero-allocation loop (HW01–HW06)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fixed-capacity circular buffers</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Every spike queue, episodic trace, and telemetry channel uses power-of-two ring buffers with explicit overflow policy (`0` unbounded `.push()`).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW06</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A. Memory arenas, explicit byte accounting &amp; zero-allocation loop (HW01–HW06)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bounded `&lt; 64 KB` creature XOR checkpoints</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Full-organism incremental rollback checkpoints compress via sparse XOR delta to `&lt; 64 KB` (while single `WSE` edits stay `&lt; 16 KB`, `WSE08`).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW07</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">B. Algorithmic complexity, stiff chemistry &amp; multirate clocks (HW07–HW12)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">`O(N_pop + C_pairs)` broad-phase physics</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Uniform spatial hash / BVH bounds broad-phase world collisions and field queries to `O(N_pop + C_pairs)` (`0` unconditional `O(N_pop²)` loops).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW08</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">B. Algorithmic complexity, stiff chemistry &amp; multirate clocks (HW07–HW12)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Integer-guarded `0 ≤ Q ≤ 10` quantum cap</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Validates `Number.isInteger(Q) &amp;&amp; Q &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; Q &lt;= 10` before allocating `2 * (2 ** Q)` `Float64` entries (`≤ 16 KiB`), preventing `1 &lt;&lt; 32 === 1` wraparound.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW09</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">B. Algorithmic complexity, stiff chemistry &amp; multirate clocks (HW07–HW12)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Event-driven sparse spike rows (`k ≈ 1–4%`)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Gear-1 spike propagation iterates outgoing CSR/packed blocks exclusively for units crossing threshold (`2–8 Hz` biological sparse regime).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">B. Algorithmic complexity, stiff chemistry &amp; multirate clocks (HW07–HW12)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5-Gear Deterministic Multirate Scheduler</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Runs integer-divided gears (`0.5ms, 5ms, 50ms, 1s, 60s`) with explicit ZOH/flux handoff, achieving `≥ 5×` measured speedup &amp; `&lt; 1%` step-halving drift.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">B. Algorithmic complexity, stiff chemistry &amp; multirate clocks (HW07–HW12)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exponential-Euler &amp; implicit stiff solvers</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Integrates linear membrane decay via exact exponential-Euler and stiff nonlinear wet chemistry via bounded backward-Euler/TR-BDF2 (`0` explicit-Euler blowups).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">B. Algorithmic complexity, stiff chemistry &amp; multirate clocks (HW07–HW12)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tier-2-only multi-fidelity crowd surrogates</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Optional distant-crowd reduced surrogates execute **exclusively in Tier-2 Adaptive Bulk Mode** under deterministic in-world salience schedules (never Tier-1).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">C. Worker isolation, backend probes &amp; two-tier determinism (HW13–HW18)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Off-main-thread simulation &amp; export workers</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Physics, neural batches, and file encoders run in dedicated Workers/threads so UI interaction never stalls `tick()`.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">C. Worker isolation, backend probes &amp; two-tier determinism (HW13–HW18)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Verified `crossOriginIsolated` + 3-retry SeqLock</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Asserts `self.crossOriginIsolated` at startup; Sim-&gt;UI `SharedArrayBuffer` uses odd/even `SeqLock` (max `3` reader retries + double-buffer fallback).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">C. Worker isolation, backend probes &amp; two-tier determinism (HW13–HW18)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Two-Tier determinism + core `exp_det`</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tier-1 CPU/WASM uses core-shipped `exp_det`/`log_det` + `.alifebin` for cross-OS SHA-256 parity; Tier-2 GPU checks preregistered observable distributions.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">C. Worker isolation, backend probes &amp; two-tier determinism (HW13–HW18)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">`Philox4x32-10` domain-isolated PRNG</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32-bit `Math.imul` `Philox4x32-10` keyed by `(ver, seed, domain, entity, organ, tick, purpose, idx)` isolating `WORLD_EXOG` from `ENTITY_INT`.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">C. Worker isolation, backend probes &amp; two-tier determinism (HW13–HW18)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Capability-probed WebGPU / SIMD kernels</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Probes `shader-f16` / SIMD support at boot, selects verified native or unpacked-`f32` software kernels, and logs active backend mode in manifest.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">C. Worker isolation, backend probes &amp; two-tier determinism (HW13–HW18)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11-Pool compensated `FP64` ledger worker</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Accumulates all enthalpy/mass pools + `E_diss_num ≥ 0` in CPU/WASM `FP64` Kahan-Neumaier state (never truncated to `WGSL f32` or `Q16.16`).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">D. Observer independence, contiguous governor &amp; sharded storage (HW19–HW24)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bounded `≤ 32 KB/fr` sketch + pull telemetry</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Streams global `O(1)` sketches every frame and pulls subgraph/raster slices strictly for the active inspector target (`ERR-01` cure).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">D. Observer independence, contiguous governor &amp; sharded storage (HW19–HW24)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10,000-tick zero-observer-effect hash gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">CI verifies `10,000` Tier-1 ticks with all 19 UI tabs open + active export + Governor Band-3 forcing match headless SHA-256 bit-for-bit.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">D. Observer independence, contiguous governor &amp; sharded storage (HW19–HW24)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contiguous hysteresis Frame-Time Governor</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">EMA `ms/frame` bands (`&lt;0.70B`, `0.70–0.90B`, `0.90–1.00B`, `&gt;1.00B` of `T_frame(Tier)`) shed render/UI rate only in Tier-1 (`30`-frame hysteresis dwell).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">D. Observer independence, contiguous governor &amp; sharded storage (HW19–HW24)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Decoupled lossless export + `&lt;500K` XLS shard</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Streams raw tensors losslessly to `Parquet`/`HDF5`/`CSV` and shards `.xls`/`.xlsx` workbooks well below Excel&apos;s `1,048,576`-row hard limit.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">D. Observer independence, contiguous governor &amp; sharded storage (HW19–HW24)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Automated Tier-E/L/D/W/C budget smoke gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">CI measures peak resident RAM/VRAM, synaptic events/s, and p99 step latency against declared Hardware Reference Tier ceilings.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
      <Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L9_HW24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HW-24 Compute &amp; Arena Guards</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">D. Observer independence, contiguous governor &amp; sharded storage (HW19–HW24)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Non-finite &amp; `85%`-arena watchdog breaker</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">☐ Not Yet</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[O(1)]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Traps any `NaN/Inf`, `ΔE_diss_num &lt; -1e-15`, or `&gt; 85%` arena water-mark, writes crash `.alifebin` + manifest, and aborts promotion cleanly.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deterministic CI Profiler &amp; Hash Gate</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Intact | Passive-Body (0-Brain) | Shuffled-Stream | Targeted-Lesion | Size-Matched-Sham</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exact paired Wilcoxon p_Holm &lt;= 0.05 (FWER m=24) &amp; delta_pair &gt;= 0.33 &amp; LCB_95% &gt; -Delta_NI</Data></Cell></Row>
